    {
      "id": 1795080593346,
      "type": "Journal",
      "detail": "",
      "date": "2026-06-04",
      "time": "20:26",
      "carer": "Daddy",
      "narrative": "When you were young my bello you looked so weird! We thought maybe you would be weird looking when you grew up, and I would say \"I will love him anyway he looks\". I would say, \"He is going to be such a great person it won't matter!\". \n\nI wish I could go home, more than anything, to hug you every day.",
